### Data License & Attribution Notice
This repository contains analytical code, data processing pipelines, and index models. The underlying raw datasets analyzed are public statistical publications of the Government of India:
1. **UDISE+ (Unified District Information System for Education Plus) AY 2024–25**: Department of School Education & Literacy, Ministry of Education, Government of India.
2. **AISHE (All India Survey on Higher Education) AY 2023–24**: Department of Higher Education, Ministry of Education, Government of India.
3. **PLFS (Periodic Labour Force Survey) CY 2025**: National Sample Survey Office (NSSO), Ministry of Statistics and Programme Implementation (MoSPI), Government of India.
4. **Primary Census Abstract (Census 2011)**: Office of the Registrar General & Census Commissioner, Ministry of Home Affairs, Government of India.

All raw government datasets remain the intellectual property of their respective issuing bodies and are accessed under the provisions of the National Data Sharing and Accessibility Policy (NDSAP) of the Government of India for non-commercial research, analysis, and educational purposes with appropriate attribution.
